  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "The Spellsword had defeated every enemy, leaving the castle silent behind
    him. He stepped into the overgrown garden, the air fresh and warm on his face.
    \n\n\nGrass and wildflowers brushed against his legs, and the faint hum of insects
    filled the quiet space. He paused, letting himself take in the open sky above,
    the soft wind carrying away the tension in his shoulders.\n\n\n After so long
    trapped in stone halls and shadowed corridors, he finally felt the weight of
    captivity lift. \n\n\nHe was free at last, and the world beyond the castle gates
    stretched out before him, full of possibilities he had long been denied.\n\n\nCredits"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8404b1f0b5ed6c84f86e7fadafe78fbd, type: 2}
